@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+### Added
+- Added range selection to the segments list: SHIFT+click selects all segments between the last selected segment and the clicked one (within the same group). CTRL+SHIFT+click (CMD+SHIFT+click on macOS) adds the range to the existing selection. Press ESC or click the empty space below the segments list to clear the selection.
